ld text-[var(--primary)]\">database schema</strong> <!-- -->under the hood or polishing a<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-semibold text-[var(--primary)]\">responsive CSS grid</strong> <!-- -->on the frontend, I take pride in crafting seamless applications from end to end.</p><p>Currently based in the Philippines, I&#x27;ve had the opportunity to provide technical support for<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-semibold text-[var(--primary)]\">digital agencies</strong> <!-- -->and develop<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-semibold text-[var(--primary)]\">full-stack platforms</strong> <!-- -->for freelance clients. I thrive in the space where<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-semibold text-[var(--primary)]\">aesthetics meet engineering</strong>, and I&#x27;m always eager to tackle new challenges that allow me to bring great ideas to life on the web.</p></div></section><section id=\"experience\" class=\"mb-16 scroll-mt-16 md:mb-24 lg:mb-36 lg:scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest opacity-80 lg:hidden mb-6\">Experience</h2><ol class=\"group/list\"><li class=\"mb-12 group relative flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-8 transition-all duration-300 p-4 md:p-6 -mx-4 md:-mx-6 rounded-2xl hover:bg-[var(--hover-bg)] hover:shadow-sm lg:hover:!opacity-100 lg:group-hover/list:opacity-50\"><header class=\"md:w-1/4 mt-1 shrink-0\"><time class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50\">2025 - Present</time></header><div class=\"md:w-3/4\"><h3 class=\"font-medium text-lg text-[var(--foreground)] transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\">Freelance Web Developer</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-70 text-[var(--foreground)]\">Designed, developed, and deployed a full blog platform using modern web development practices. Managed the project end-to-end: planning, development, testing, deployment, and performance optimization.</p><ul class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center rounded-full bg-[var(--prima