-full bg-[var(--primary)]/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--primary)]\">Agile/Scrum</li></ul></div></li><li class=\"mb-12 group relative flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-8 transition-all duration-300 p-4 md:p-6 -mx-4 md:-mx-6 rounded-2xl hover:bg-[var(--hover-bg)] hover:shadow-sm lg:hover:!opacity-100 lg:group-hover/list:opacity-50\"><header class=\"md:w-1/4 mt-1 shrink-0\"><time class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50\">2021 — 2022</time></header><div class=\"md:w-3/4\"><h3 class=\"font-medium text-lg text-[var(--foreground)] transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\">Full-Stack Web Development Program<span class=\"opacity-70\"> · <!-- -->UNF Coding Bootcamp</span></h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-70 text-[var(--foreground)]\">Completed an intensive 6-month part-time program focused on full-stack JavaScript. Gained hands-on experience building responsive front-end interfaces and robust back-end APIs, culminating in a comprehensive e-commerce capstone project.</p><ul class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center rounded-full bg-[var(--primary)]/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--primary)]\">JavaScript</li><li class=\"flex items-center rounded-full bg-[var(--primary)]/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--primary)]\">React</li><li class=\"flex items-center rounded-full bg-[var(--primary)]/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--primary)]\">Node.js</li><li class=\"flex items-center rounded-full bg-[var(--primary)]/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--primary)]\">PostgreSQL</li><li class=\"flex items-center rounded-full bg-[var(--primary)]/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--primary)]\">Express</li></ul></div></li></ol><div class=\"mt-12\"><a href=\"/Emma Nagano&#x27;s Resume _ Web Dev.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-[var(--foreground)] hover:text-[var(--primary)] transi